WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.572
Work through the examples by reading the idea, running the code, and then making a small change.

00:00:06.572 --> 00:00:10.497
With collections, small edits are especially useful.

00:00:10.497 --> 00:00:18.050
Add one value, remove one value, change an index, or adjust a slice and watch what happens.

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:21.672
Try to describe the result before you run the cell.

00:00:21.672 --> 00:00:28.122
That habit helps you understand how Python is organizing the data instead of relying on trial and error.
